# Item Mall architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/item-mall.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/item-mall.md).

**Permanent decision:** **ARC** ≠ **AsteronCredits (AC)**. AC spends only in
the **Item Mall**. Money grants AC **only** via Stripe webhook fulfillment —
never checkout create, client confirm, or redirect. All AC mutations go through
`apply_credit_delta` + append-only ledger + idempotency key. `MallListing` is
a layer over `ItemDefinition` (live catalog). Sellable types gated server-side
(`consumable` today) — widen `mall.rs` and Console `MALL_SELLABLE_ITEM_TYPES`
together. Pay UI: [Stripe](../../docs/docs/architecture/stripe.md). Play
surface: HaloBand Mall tab
([HaloBand](../../docs/docs/architecture/haloband.md)). Operator how-to:
[Payments](../../docs/docs/server-console/payments.md).

When changing mall purchase, credit packs, Stripe webhook, ledger, sellable
types, or Commerce Console panels, read the full doc first. Also listed in
`AGENTS.md`.
